## Challenge

If the company _____ the new system earlier, productivity would have increased.

A. implements
B. implemented
C. had implemented
D. has implemented

Answer: C

---

## Key Point

현재 반대:

If + 과거
→ would + V

과거 반대:

If + had p.p.
→ would have p.p.
